<Positioned left="98.0" top="770">
<Text color="#F1F7FBFF" fontSize="21.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="10^0.10 = 1.259" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="98.0" top="802">
<Text color="#FFC15EFF" fontSize="38.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="+25.9%" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="247.26" top="816">
<Text color="#6E8AA0FF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="≈ 26%" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="98.0" top="860" width="469.0" height="42.75">
<Text color="#6E8AA0FF" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" text="NOAA 教育页：表层 pH 自工业革命以来下降约 0.1 单位。同一机构在 OA Program 页给出 250 年平均「约 26%」——同一个 0.1，两种取整。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="613.0" top="726" width="509.0" height="244">
<Container color="#0A1A28F2" borderRadius="14.0" border="1 SOLID #1D3A50FF" width="509.0" height="244" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="633.0" top="744">
<Text color="#FF7A6BFF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="Δ 0.12" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="633.0" top="770">
<Text color="#F1F7FBFF" fontSize="21.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="10^0.12 = 1.318" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="633.0" top="802">
<Text color="#FF7A6BFF" fontSize="38.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="+31.8%" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="782.26" top="816">
<Text color="#6E8AA0FF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="≈ 30%" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="633.0" top="860" width="469.0" height="42.75">
<Text color="#6E8AA0FF" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" letterSpacing="0.1" text="按 Jiang et al. 2023 的全球面积平均 8.19 → 8.07 计算，落在 NOAA 「约 30%」的范围内。所以两个官方数字都成立，不是矛盾。" />
</Positioned>
